      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُعَيْدَآءُ</span></b>  <i>What is thrown away from wheat when
it is picked,</i> or <i>cleansed,</i> (L, K,) <i>as the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُوَان</span> [or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُؤَان</span>, q. v.,] <i>and the like:</i> by some written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رغيدآء</span>;
but the former is more correct. (L.)

